WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.125
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:06.000
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.625
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:09.916
and start getting Re-al.

00:00:09.916 --> 00:00:10.666
This is

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:11.875
The Champions.

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:15.250
I’m so excited to make a big difference at Bayern…

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.541
maybe this season we can beat Barca 9-2.

00:00:18.541 --> 00:00:22.500
-It took a bribery scandal to get Harry Maguire on the front page.

00:00:22.541 --> 00:00:24.666
Me? All it took was a haircut.

00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:29.041
-I never cheated on my Italian citizenship test.

00:00:29.041 --> 00:00:30.375
PRODUCER: Are you reading that off a paper?

00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:31.375
-No!

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:46.541
-(Grunts)

00:00:46.541 --> 00:00:48.000
-Well, that's a bit odd.

00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:51.250
-Everyone's been curious about my incredible man management

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.250
of Christian Pulisic.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.416
Well, I kind of told him a lie...

00:00:55.416 --> 00:01:00.541
as a form of motivation! Haha but no, I'm definitely manipulating him.

00:01:00.541 --> 00:01:05.625
Ok, ok...I told Christian if he played really well this season

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:09.000
I could maybe get him a job in the Queen's Secret Service.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.750
-What?! Why would you do this?

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:15.500
-Beg your pardon. Forgot to knock.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.750
Being a secret agent is totally awesome.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:22.375
I get to do one-liners and climb around in the air vent, plus,

00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:23.916
Chelsea has so much money to burn,

00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:26.125
they bought me, like, all these cool new gadgets!

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:30.875
Haha!

00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:35.750
-Alright lads, everybody on the coach!

00:01:36.125 --> 00:01:38.875
-Spy! Take the mask off!
-Get off me!

00:01:38.875 --> 00:01:40.250
-What did you do with Frank?!

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:40.875
-Stop it!

00:01:51.541 --> 00:01:53.375
Oh, that is you. Hey, Frank!

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:58.750
-I fear Christian’s taken the spy bit a bit too far.

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.750
If I’m to get him back onside, I’ll have to call in the big guns.

00:02:04.625 --> 00:02:07.500
Hello, Jose. No, sorry, no time to talk right now.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:10.875
Um, may I have Zlatan's number, please?

00:02:12.625 --> 00:02:13.625
-Yeah, boy.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:17.375
Pulisic. Christian, Pulisic.

00:02:17.875 --> 00:02:18.416
Huh?

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:23.166
Zlatan?

00:02:24.416 --> 00:02:25.750
(Gasp) Ibrahimovic!!!

00:02:28.791 --> 00:02:31.250
Oh my god, oh my god, oh my god!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:40.625
Zlatan! I got your note about the secret mission!

00:02:40.625 --> 00:02:42.125
-Shhh. Be cool, be cool.

00:02:42.125 --> 00:02:44.750
Ok, here is the stupid backstory:

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:49.125
Someone is kidnapping footballers and turning them into...

00:02:49.125 --> 00:02:51.250
human trophies!!

00:02:51.875 --> 00:02:52.625
-(Gasp) Oh my god.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.291
-There he is! Grab him!

00:02:54.291 --> 00:02:56.041
-I've said too much! Run!

00:02:57.291 --> 00:02:59.250
-Hey! Leave him alone!

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.125
We were in the middle of a conversation!

00:03:02.041 --> 00:03:04.125
-Ooo, fresh meat!

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:07.250
-How bout a taste of this Hershey CHOPlet!

00:03:08.875 --> 00:03:10.750
-Don't bother following us, Christian.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.166
You'll never find us at our evil lair

00:03:12.166 --> 00:03:14.250
located on Roman Abramovich's yacht,

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:18.500
which is the only boat in the harbor, 100 meters that way.

00:03:19.125 --> 00:03:21.000
-Dang it, they got away!

00:03:21.666 --> 00:03:25.416
Gosh. Now I’ll never find their evil lair.

00:03:25.416 --> 00:03:28.666
Hmmm, where could it possibly be?

00:03:29.291 --> 00:03:31.250
-The boat! They’re on the boat, man.

00:03:31.875 --> 00:03:33.375
-I bet they’re on the boat.

00:03:41.125 --> 00:03:42.500
-(Yelling)

00:03:48.541 --> 00:03:50.625
Oh wow, the Zlatan statue.

00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:51.750
They must have fixed it.

00:03:52.666 --> 00:03:54.125
Nose is a little small, though.

00:03:54.125 --> 00:03:56.000
-No, I've been turned into a trophy, you idiot!

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.000
-Shh, trophies don't talk.

00:03:58.541 --> 00:03:59.916
-(Laughing)

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:02.791
-Congratulations, ding-dong.

00:04:02.791 --> 00:04:03.541
You found me.

00:04:03.541 --> 00:04:05.041
-Sergio Ramos?!

00:04:05.041 --> 00:04:06.166
-Who else?

00:04:06.166 --> 00:04:08.041
No, seriously, who else would be the bad guy?

00:04:08.041 --> 00:04:09.500
-I'm gonna stop you!

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.375
-Well, you can either stop me

00:04:11.375 --> 00:04:13.666
or save your friends!

00:04:14.291 --> 00:04:15.416
-Please, save us.

00:04:15.416 --> 00:04:17.000
-Yes, we are so scared.

00:04:17.375 --> 00:04:19.500
-The choice is yours, Mr. Pulisic!

00:04:21.875 --> 00:04:26.500
-Hmmm. My friends? Or Sergio Ramos?

00:04:27.041 --> 00:04:33.500
My friends? Or Sergio Ramos?

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.750
My friend-

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:37.000
-Bruv! You can do both, just get a move on.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:37.625
-Right!

00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:39.791
Hang in there, chaps.

00:04:39.791 --> 00:04:40.625
I'll get you down!

00:04:40.625 --> 00:04:41.375
-Wait, don't-

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:46.250
-Gee. Thanks, Christian. You saved us.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.166
-Hasta la vista, baby!

00:04:50.875 --> 00:04:52.291
Your Majesty?

00:04:52.541 --> 00:04:55.541
-Oh, gasp! Save me, Mr. Pulisic!

00:04:55.541 --> 00:04:58.125
-Let the Queen go, Sergio Ramos!

00:04:58.125 --> 00:04:58.875
-(Shouting)

00:04:58.875 --> 00:05:01.166
-Alright, alright! I'm going, jeez.

00:05:01.166 --> 00:05:02.375
What an overreaction, this guy.

00:05:02.916 --> 00:05:05.375
-Oh! Thank you, Agent 10.

00:05:05.375 --> 00:05:07.666
You really gave it 110 percent.

00:05:07.666 --> 00:05:10.000
Terrific, a proper spy job.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.666
But that must have been very stressful and overwhelming.

00:05:13.666 --> 00:05:14.500
Hmmm?

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.625
Enough to make you never want to be a spy again?

00:05:18.125 --> 00:05:20.500
-Are you kidding? I'm just getting started.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.625
C'mon, give me another mission!

00:05:21.625 --> 00:05:22.250
Give me another mission!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.541
Anything! Anything!

00:05:24.541 --> 00:05:27.166
-I now realize my lie has sent Christian

00:05:27.166 --> 00:05:29.541
down a dangerous path of self-delusion.

00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:32.625
Welp, there's only one way to sort this:

00:05:32.625 --> 00:05:34.125
with an even bigger lie.

00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:36.375
Alright, one more mission.

00:05:36.375 --> 00:05:40.625
I need you to go undercover as a Chelsea footballer.

00:05:40.625 --> 00:05:43.875
So deep under cover that you'll never speak

00:05:43.875 --> 00:05:46.750
of being a spy ever again.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.166
Ever. Got it?

00:05:50.041 --> 00:05:52.875
-Oohhh that is so smart!

00:05:52.875 --> 00:05:55.291
I mean, I don't get it at all,

00:05:55.291 --> 00:05:57.166
but it sounds really smart.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.375
-There must've been an easier way to do this.

00:06:03.375 --> 00:06:05.875
-Last one to training’s a rotten egg!

00:06:06.375 --> 00:06:08.000
-Hope there’s no lasers in there!

00:06:08.625 --> 00:06:09.625
Right?

00:06:09.625 --> 00:06:10.625
Please, Christian.

00:06:10.916 --> 00:06:13.791
-Ha! Don't worry, that's all behind me.

00:06:13.791 --> 00:06:17.416
I'm just a regular ole football player guy now.

00:06:17.416 --> 00:06:18.500
-Splendid!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.916
-Good show, Agent Pulisic.

00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:25.875
You’ve made Britain proud.

00:06:25.875 --> 00:06:28.000
And Frank doesn't suspect a thing.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:31.000
-And he never will.

00:06:59.625 --> 00:07:02.625
Oi! If you enjoyed this jolly good show,

00:07:02.625 --> 00:07:03.500
please make sure to

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.000
like and subscribe to B/R Football!

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.291
Cheerio!

